Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:06:46 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1195/1198] HERESY 1168: Max length lives in Sampling; Reset
 output resets the solver; Denoising steps; Ctrl+F by the key and in a lifted
 frame; the text profile off with a music profile
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 07.10.2026, from the road:
- «В Sound and Output поле max length так и осталось»: his «sampler's block» (that field to go, the seconds passed there)
  was Sound and output, whose solver is the sampler; I had read it the other way round and hidden the music's Max tokens.
  Now the song's Max length is set in Sampling, the music's time, editable and with no lock (it is the song's length, as
  the field it replaces was); Sound and output has no length field; the request's duration follows the one in Sampling.
  The duration is written before the bounds' guard runs (guardKnob re-syncs the ceiling from it: written after, the old
  length pulled the new one straight back, as the first check of it showed: 3:00 typed, 6:00 kept).
- «Reset output не обнуляет выбор резолвера»: the solver back to midpoint too; the toast says it, with the length.
- «ODE STEPS замени на понятное DENOISING STEPS»: the label, its (i)'s name and its refusal, in the six catalogs too.
- Ctrl+F (his first try: «Повторно Ctrl+F — всплыло браузерное… Снова Ctrl+F — твой виджет больше не появляется»; «какой-то
  оверлейный прямоугольник начал плавать»): the key is read (KeyF), not its letter, which a Russian layout gives as «а»;
  in a lifted frame (zoomed 1.2) the mark is measured in the box's own pixels and drawn at its scale.
- «Если у Творца ПРОФИЛЬ - музыка, деактивируй текстовый профиль, потому что он чисто для начитки»: the text profile row is
  off (dimmed, its tip saying why) while the Profile chosen is music; on with the built-in Speech, or one of the user's in
  Direct mode longer than eight minutes, or named for speech or reading.

The suite: 381 passed, 0 failed (5 new checks: the length in Sampling and the request's duration, Reset output's solver,
Ctrl+F in a Russian layout from the box, from the bar and after a close, the mark in a lifted frame, the text profile row).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
